DataTypes for the construction of the XML signature syntax
Please check:
Section 7.9.2.4.2 XML Signature mechanism from ISO 15118-2
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML_Signature
https://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core1/
